    "version_difference": "CN has 316 physical lines; EN has 317 because of one extra terminal newline. All 163 named dialogue positions and 153 command lines align by physical line. Six language-specific Decision option payloads differ; values and Predicate references match exactly. CN is primary for meaning; EN Yostar is the name and structure cross-check."
